    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Vector pods not ready",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "count(kube_pod_status_ready{namespace=\"monitoring\",pod=~\"vector-pleme-vector-.*\",condition=\"true\"} == 0) or vector(0)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "vm"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1.0
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1.0
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [

        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true,
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "description": "Vector DaemonSet pods with the Ready condition false. This is the TRUE \"vector down\" — the agent itself is not serving, so logs stop shipping off that node. (Distinct from a metrics-scrape blip: pod-readiness is the workload, not the :9090 endpoint.) Red = a vector pod is down NOW."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Component errors /s",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(vector_component_errors_total[5m])) or vector(0)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "vm"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [

        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true,
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "description": "Errors/s summed across every Vector component (source/transform/sink). vector_component_errors_total has no series until the first error fires, so the floored tile reads a green 0 today and lights up the moment Vector errors. Any sustained rate = drop the per-component breakdown in the Errors & drops row."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Events discarded /s",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(vector_component_discarded_events_total[5m])) or vector(0)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "vm"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1.0
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [

        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true,
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "description": "Events/s Vector DISCARDED (over-capacity buffer, parse failure, route drop) — data loss. Absent until the first discard, so the floored tile reads a green 0 today. >0 = logs are being dropped on the floor; investigate immediately."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Buffer fullness %",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max(100 * vector_buffer_byte_size / vector_buffer_max_byte_size) or vector(0)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "vm"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 70.0
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 90.0
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [

        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true,
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "description": "Fullest sink buffer as a % of its max (the loki sink uses a 512Mi disk buffer). A climbing buffer = the sink (VictoriaLogs) can't keep up with ingest and Vector is queueing on disk; →100% = the buffer overflows and events get discarded."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Component utilization %",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max(100 * vector_utilization) or vector(0)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "vm"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 85.0
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 95.0
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [

        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true,
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "description": "Busiest component's utilization (vector_utilization is 0..1 per component). High = that source/transform/sink is saturated and applying back-pressure upstream; sustained >95% = the bottleneck stage that is throttling the whole pipeline."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Memory near limit %",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 20,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max(100 * max by(pod)(container_memory_working_set_bytes{namespace=\"monitoring\",pod=~\"vector-pleme-vector-.*\",container=\"vector\"}) / on(pod) max by(pod)(kube_pod_container_resource_limits{namespace=\"monitoring\",pod=~\"vector-pleme-vector-.*\",resource=\"memory\"})) or vector(0)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "vm"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 80.0
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 95.0
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [

        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true,
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "description": "Vector working-set as a % of its memory limit. The max by(pod) on BOTH sides dedupes rio's dual container scrape (kubelet + cAdvisor) so the join doesn't error. >95% = the cgroup OOM killer is near — Vector dies and log shipping stalls."
    },
